                            <div class="event_detail_text">
                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On 25 June 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre held an immersive CAD Simulation Workshop at its Rohini Sector-6 location, near Visram Chowk, specifically for ITI Mori Gate DMC students. This workshop aimed to equip students with foundational and advanced skills in CAD simulation, offering a unique opportunity to experience live, hands-on learning.
                                    Throughout the workshop, students explored essential tools like AutoCAD and 3ds Max, learning how to apply these skills in real-world industrial settings. The program was designed to provide comprehensive knowledge, starting from the basics of CAD and progressing to more complex concepts. Students engaged deeply with the material, benefiting from Skillbook's expert tutors who guided them every step of the way.
                                    By the end of the workshop, participants were thrilled with their newfound knowledge and the practical skills they gained. The students left with smiles and expressed their gratitude to Skillbook for the invaluable experience, ready to apply their skills to future career opportunities.
                                    Skillbook continues to support student growth and development through workshops like these, providing free, high-quality education for those eager to excel.
                                    </p>
                                <a class="theam_btn btn2 text_white bg_color" href="/#contactIncq">Join Us</a>
                            </div>
